  "description": "It’s all about balance, right? Which is why we’ve designed our MISFIT Balance bike to look and ride as much like a full-sized BMX bike as possible, but paired it with safety grips, domed axle-nuts and vertical rear-dropouts to keep it safe for your little misfit. The TIG welded frame with foot pegs, 2pc bars and front-load stem make this thing look legit, while a quick-release seat clamp for seat height changes on the fly and curved valve stems for easy pump access make life easier on mom and dad. Look, we’ll guarantee it… get your kid started on this MISFIT, and you’re gonna lay the groundwork for having a little shredder on your hands in no time at all.",
